---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Set Up a Project First — Luxon Learn" description="Stop learning prompts. Projects are the real secret — and most tutorials skip this.">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/legacy-shared.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/learn/learn-styles.css" />
  </Fragment>

  <!-- Lesson Hero -->
  <section class="lesson-hero">
    <div class="lesson-breadcrumb">
      <a href="/learn">Learn</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span>Lesson 2</span>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson-badge">Level 1</div>
    <h1>Set Up a Project First</h1>
    <p class="lesson-subtitle">Stop learning prompts. Projects are the real secret — and most tutorials skip this.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="lesson-content">

    <!-- Visual: Scattered vs Organized -->
    <div class="lesson-visual">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 640 300" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <!-- Scattered papers (no project) -->
        <rect x="20" y="30" width="280" height="240" rx="16" fill="#fef2f2" stroke="#fecaca"/>
        <text x="40" y="58" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#dc2626" font-weight="700">❌ NO PROJECT</text>
        <rect x="40" y="76" width="80" height="60" rx="4" fill="#fff" stroke="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(-8 80 106)"/>
        <rect x="100" y="90" width="80" height="60" rx="4" fill="#fff" stroke="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(5 140 120)"/>
        <rect x="60" y="150" width="80" height="60" rx="4" fill="#fff" stroke="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(-3 100 180)"/>
        <rect x="150" y="140" width="80" height="60" rx="4" fill="#fff" stroke="#e5e7eb" transform="rotate(7 190 170)"/>
        <text x="40" y="240" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#80868b">No memory. Starting from scratch every time.</text>

        <!-- Organized folder (with project) -->
        <rect x="340" y="30" width="280" height="240" rx="16" fill="#f0fdf4" stroke="#bbf7d0"/>
        <text x="360" y="58" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="700">✓ PROJECT</text>
        <rect x="390" y="76" width="180" height="24" rx="4" fill="#16a34a"/>
        <rect x="390" y="72" width="60" height="12" rx="4" fill="#16a34a"/>
        <text x="402" y="92" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#fff" font-weight="600">📋 My Project</text>
        <rect x="400" y="112" width="160" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="412" y="130" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#3c4043">📄 Custom instructions</text>
        <rect x="400" y="148" width="160" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="412" y="166" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#3c4043">📄 Past chat history</text>
        <rect x="400" y="184" width="160" height="28" rx="6" fill="#fff" stroke="#86efac"/>
        <text x="412" y="202" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="10" fill="#3c4043">📄 Uploaded files</text>
        <text x="360" y="240" font-family="Inter,sans-serif" font-size="11" fill="#16a34a" font-weight="600">AI remembers everything. Gets smarter over time ✓</text>

        <!-- Arrow -->
        <path d="M310 150 L330 150" stroke="#4285f4" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead2)"/>
        <defs><marker id="arrowhead2" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="6" refX="8" refY="3" orient="auto"><polygon points="0 0, 8 3, 0 6" fill="#4285f4"/></marker></defs>
      </svg>
      <p class="lesson-visual-caption">Scattered chats forget everything. A project remembers — and gets smarter each time.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Steps -->
    <div class="lesson-steps">
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">1</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>What is a project?</h3>
          <p>A project is like an organizing folder with memory. Instead of starting fresh every chat, the AI remembers your preferences, files, and past conversations. It's the single biggest upgrade most people never make.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">2</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>The Rule of Two</h3>
          <p>If you do something more than twice — weekly reports, customer emails, lesson plans — make it a project. That's it. If it's recurring, it deserves a project.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="lesson-step">
        <div class="lesson-step__number">3</div>
        <div class="lesson-step__content">
          <h3>How to create one</h3>
          <p><strong>Claude:</strong> Click "Create Project" in the sidebar.<br><strong>ChatGPT:</strong> Click the project icon in the sidebar. Name it after what you're working on — "Weekly Reports," "Client Emails," "Course Content."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tip -->
    <div class="lesson-tip">
      <div class="lesson-tip__icon">💡</div>
      <div class="lesson-tip__text"><strong>Pro tip:</strong> Once your project is created, ask the AI to write its own instructions: "Help me write the best custom instructions for this project." It knows what it needs better than you do.</div>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="lesson-cta">
      <h3>Want this set up for you?</h3>
      <p>We configure everything — personalization, projects, and workflows — in one session.</p>
      <a href="https://wa.me/85297381028" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Book installation</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Lesson Nav -->
  <div class="lesson-nav">
    <a href="/learn/lesson-1" class="prev"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M19 12H5m7-7-7 7 7 7"/></svg> AI vs Google Search</a>
    <a href="/learn/lesson-3" class="next">Personalize Your AI <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" width="16" height="16"><path d="M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
